# Data Hub module map

| Module | Path | Role |
|--------|------|------|
| Auth | `apps/api/src/auth/` | Service-to-service auth |
| Ingest | `apps/api/src/ingest/` | Inbound data pipelines |
| Registry | `apps/api/src/registry/` | Reference/catalog registry (`fx`, `banks`, `companies`, `hs`, `geo`, `uom`, `currencies`, `tax-rates`, `chart-of-accounts`, `calendar`, `iban`) |
| Cache | `apps/api/src/cache/` | Cached lookups |
| Prisma | `apps/api/src/prisma/` | DB access (`referenceDb()` → finance_ro \| hub) |

**Schema:** `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma` (includes ISO `Currency` catalog — distinct from `CbarOfficialRate` FX).

Cross-system catalog sync: `db:sync-from-finance` (includes currencies upsert by code). See `docs/adr/era-data-hub.md`.
